  "summary": "Payload: Unauthorized update to collection documents",
  "details": "## Impact\n\nAn attacker can submit a request to a specific endpoint that permits collection documents to be updated regardless of access control and field level access control.\n\n**You are affected if:**\n\n- You are configuring `orderable: true` with any collection or join field.\n\n## Patches\n\nIn the patched version access control is properly enforced.\n\nUsers should upgrade Payload packages to `>= 3.90.0` or `>= 4.0.0-canary.34`.",
